OL,3,GNEWSAVillage to vote on 'leaving UK'
OL,4,Aover migrant plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a village where about 930
OL,7,Fmigrants could be housed at a former
OL,8,FRAF base have voted to hold a
OL,9,Freferendum on leaving the UK.
OL,11,FRAF Barnham in Suffolk was one of three
OL,12,FMinistry of Defence (MoD) sites named
OL,13,Fin June as potential locations for
OL,14,Fasylum housing, as the government vowed
OL,15,Fto move away from hotel-based
OL,16,Faccommodation.
OL,18,FOpposition to the proposals has led to
OL,19,Fprotests outside the base, near
OL,20,FThetford in Norfolk, with villagers now
OL,21,Fset to vote on whether to symbolically
OL,22,Fsecede from the country.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
