OL,3,GNEWSAVillage to vote on 'leaving UK'
OL,4,Aover migrant plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said: "We recognise the
OL,7,Fstrength of feeling in local
OL,8,Fcommunities and are listening carefully
OL,9,Fto the concerns being raised."
